{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51720","headline":"放生池（大慈寺东北有池，号曰放生池。蜀人竞以三元日，多将鹅鸭放在池中。裕因谒主池僧不遇，当门书一绝句，自此放生稍息矣。） · 陈裕","name":"放生池（大慈寺东北有池，号曰放生池。蜀人竞以三元日，多将鹅鸭放在池中。裕因谒主池僧不遇，当门书一绝句，自此放生稍息矣。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹅鸭同羣世所知，蜀人竞送放生池。\n比来养狗图鸡在，不那闍梨是野狸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}